      "message": "fix(ui): the Stock page keeps the raw-stock row with no models\n\nThe tidy's source_fields returned early with no models, so the\nraw-stock row and its hint were hidden; before the layout change they\nshowed. Render the row in the no-models case too, inside the Source\ngroup. Pinned by the_stock_page_keeps_the_raw_stock_row_with_no_models.\n\nRefs #1440\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
